# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# NOT the file the API loads.
#
# This repo previously had two drifting .env.example files. The canonical one
# is now api/.env.example — dotenv reads from the cwd, and the API is started
# from api/, so api/.env is what's actually read. Copy that one.
#
#   cp api/.env.example api/.env
#
# The ML service has its own separate ml/.env and needs:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://vibemeet:vibemeet@localhost:5432/vibemeet
#   REDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379
#
# Object storage setup (Backblaze B2 or MinIO): see docs/STORAGE.md
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
